[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4804.149, "timestamp": "01:20:04", "text": "我曾经也做过一次，就像是新鲜的一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4807.99, "timestamp": "01:20:07", "text": "就像新的一样。啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4810.149, "timestamp": "01:20:10", "text": "是的。我没太投入进去。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4812.149, "timestamp": "01:20:12", "text": "当时我就是想那样做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4814.63, "timestamp": "01:20:14", "text": "融入等等等等。然后我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4816.709, "timestamp": "01:20:16", "text": "停止这样做了。我当时并没有这种感觉"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4819.59, "timestamp": "01:20:19", "text": "我就是那种会这么做的人。而且，我已经"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4822.31, "timestamp": "01:20:22", "text": "就像制定了一条自我约束的规则，比如，是的，不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4825.11, "timestamp": "01:20:25", "text": "喝酒、抽烟、吸毒或其他任何类似的事情。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4828.31, "timestamp": "01:20:28", "text": "注意身体健康，注意安全。这样好多了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4830.95, "timestamp": "01:20:30", "text": "是的。也这样做，因为就像我一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4832.63, "timestamp": "01:20:32", "text": "事情就是这样，对吧？我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4834.709, "timestamp": "01:20:34", "text": "我没有撒谎，我的老婆可以为此作证。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4839.27, "timestamp": "01:20:39", "text": "我大概一年只抽一两次烟吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4840.59, "timestamp": "01:20:40", "text": "每一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4843.59, "timestamp": "01:20:43", "text": "大概六个月吧，如果我只有超级状态的话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4846.95, "timestamp": "01:20:46", "text": "压力大到我真是气炸了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4848.95, "timestamp": "01:20:48", "text": "正在做某事。所以，这就像是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4850.55, "timestamp": "01:20:50", "text": "可能只有这个时候我才会抽烟"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4853.83, "timestamp": "01:20:53", "text": "每6个月一到两次。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4856.55, "timestamp": "01:20:56", "text": "我做这件事不是因为它好玩。我 我 我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4859.11, "timestamp": "01:20:59", "text": "理解为什么人们觉得这很有趣"}]